ng>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nA demanding client takes up a lot of Jill's time and then asks to speak to Jill's boss about her performance. Jill's boss assures her that her performance is fine, which Jill does not trust.\n\n## Question \nIn this scenario, what is the most effective Action for Jill?\n\n## Choices\nA) Talk to her friends or workmates about it\nB) Ignore the incident and move on to her next task\nC) Calm down by taking deep breaths or going for a short walk\nD) Think that she has been successful in the past and this client being difficult is not her fault.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0011693149235849775,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8ccd6006945d280a656","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369740866,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:20","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"99f5a17cd0944b9d800ed1907a9f320d"}